I found riscv-dv’s generated `ecall_handler` is intentionally a test terminator. The harness fix needs two parts: final `test_done` remains a tohost sentinel, while any trap-stream `ecall` branches through a replacement handler that advances `mepc` and `mret`s just like illegal/ebreak resume paths.
