codex
The pyflow generator does not expose `--no_ecall`; only the SystemVerilog flow has that knob. I’m removing that option and relying on the harness-level final sentinel plus directed/injected ecall coverage, while keeping ebreak, illegal, and unaligned load/store generation enabled.
apply patch
