codex
I’m also injecting a small fixed trap prologue at `main` so every seed exercises ecall, ebreak, illegal, misaligned load, and misaligned store even if the random generator density misses one on a short seed. The random ebreak/illegal/unaligned knobs remain enabled, so longer runs still get randomized trap placement.
