codex
riscv-dv’s pyflow RV32IMC instruction template does not include `EBREAK`, so enabling random ebreak causes a generator `KeyError` before any simulation. I’m keeping ebreak as a harness-injected synchronous trap instead, which still feeds the same generated mtvec handler and Spike/DUT memory map.
apply patch
